The '''Lothal resistance camp''',<ref name="USW NE">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> also known as '''Azadi's camp''',<ref name="Encyclopedia">{{EncyclopediaCite|Freedom Fighters From Lothal and Other Characters}}</ref> was used by the [[Lothal resistance group]] during the [[time]] the [[Spectres]] mounted a [[Theft of the TIE Defender Elite|mission]] to [[Lothal]]<ref name="The Occupation" />  in [[1 BBY]].<ref name="Occupation Date">{{RebelsDate|405}}</ref> It was located in the [[planet]]'s northern hemisphere, hidden in a mountainous area. After an [[Rukh|agent]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] tracked members of the Spectres and the Lothal resistance back to the camp after they recovered a [[hyperdrive]], the Imperials attacked and took over the camp, with the rebels escaping under the guidance of the mysterious [[Loth-wolf|loth-wolves]]. After the rebels retreated, Imperial forces [[bomb]]ed the surrounding area.<ref name="Kindred">{{Rebels|Kindred}}</ref>

